5,1,1,talk,May,,I think we should be careful not to repeat old mistakes. I'll start by looking into the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I agree that historical context is useful. To ensure we have the personnel to actually execute these plans, I will examine the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I want to make sure we are addressing the real bottlenecks for our passengers. I'll look into the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city, as well as the journey audits on where minutes go.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is so wonderful to see everyone thinking of different perspectives. I shall look into the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells and the joint operators' committee minutes to see who must be consulted.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I believe it is important to understand the long-term financial commitments we are making. I will look into the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"It seems we have a very comprehensive list covered. @Benjamin, @Midori, @Shizue, @Jonathan—does anyone feel we've missed a critical angle, or are we satisfied with this distribution of research?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Midori"",""Shizue"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I believe we have covered the operational, financial, and historical bases quite thoroughly. Unless someone has a sudden epiphany, I am satisfied with this distribution.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,I agree. It feels like we have a very balanced approach. I'm looking forward to seeing what we all discover so we can make the best choice for the passengers.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree as well. It is a pleasure to work with such a thoughtful group. I am quite content with our choices and look forward to hearing your findings.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. We have a wide range of data points to consider. I am content to proceed with these selections.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"Since we are all in agreement, I'm happy to move forward. I'll be curious to see if the past holds any warnings for us.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
